{{also|biene}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|bine}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|bini}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*biniz}}, representing an ''-n-'' variant of Germanic {{m|gem-pro|*bijō}}. Cognate with {{etyl|bar|-}} {{m|bar|Bein||bee}}, {{etyl|osx|-}} {{m|osx|bini}}. Compare from ''*bijō'' the form ''Bei(e)'' in many dialects (Luxembourgish {{m|lb|Bei||bee}}, Alemannic {{m|gsw|Beie||bee}}).

